WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:03.067
-Welcome, welcome, welcome.
Enjoy yourself.

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.734
Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:06.934
[ Applause ]
Thank you for being here.

00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:10.200
Guys, it seems like there's
so much going on right now.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.000
Former President Trump is
being sued by

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.601
New York's attorney general
for fraud.

00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:17.133
The United Nations General
Assembly is underway.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:21.267
This weekend, Disney is
re-releasing the movie "Avatar."

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:22.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:24.534
In theaters.
They're re-releasing it.

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:27.067
And the FTA is warning people
against following

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.534
a TikTok recipe for
Nyquil chicken.

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.868
There's just so much to go over,

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:33.534
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:34.801
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:40.000
♪♪

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
First up, Trump.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.167
The attorney general of New York
is suing him

00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:47.067
for allegedly lying about
the value of his assets.

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.901
Between this,
the January 6th committee,

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:50.501
and the stolen
classified documents,

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:52.734
Trump's got more problems
to deal with than...

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:54.968
the United Nations.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.701
Their big General Assembly
is this week in New York City,

00:00:57.701 --> 00:01:00.968
and every hotel, restaurant,
and street is absolutely packed.

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:02.767
But you know what isn't packed?

00:01:02.767 --> 00:01:04.534
A movie theater showing
"Avatar."

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:06.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.434
That movie came out in 2009,
and now it's being re-released.

00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:12.133
Nobody really asked for it,
but here it is.

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:13.334
Kind of like...

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:14.367
Nyquil chicken.

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:17.033
People saw the recipe on TikTok,

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:19.167
and now the FTA is saying,
stay away.

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:22.200
It sounds gross, but if you fry
it and throw it in a bucket,

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.400
it's perfect for...

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.968
Donald Trump.

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:26.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:28.200
This latest lawsuit...

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.067
[ Applause ]

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:34.000
He's in serious legal trouble,
but honestly,

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.968
by now, it kind of
feels like we've...

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:38.634
seen this movie before.

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:41.567
If you forgot, "Avatar" is about
oddly colored creatures

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.000
that have fallen on hard times,

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.000
which sounds a lot like...

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.367
Donny T.

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:47.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.601 --> 00:01:49.367
When Trump was interviewed
by state officials,

00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:50.567
he pleaded the fifth,

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:52.234
because when it came to
answering questions,

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:53.067
he was too...

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:53.934
chicken.

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:55.400
Come on, guys!

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.267
Don't make Nyquil chicken
or Tamiflu turkey

00:01:58.267 --> 00:01:59.834
or Robitussin ribs.

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:01.667
That stuff will make you turn...

00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:03.334
blue.

00:02:03.334 --> 00:02:06.367
Back in '09,
"Avatar" made over $2 billion,

00:02:06.367 --> 00:02:07.667
which is also how much...

00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:09.901
Trump said
his apartment's worth.

00:02:09.901 --> 00:02:12.234
And if you think that's legal,
you must be high on...

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:14.033
sizzurp chicken.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.968
So in conclusion...

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.434
nations unite...

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:18.968
losing fight.

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:20.267
Back in blues...

00:02:20.267 --> 00:02:21.634
chicken snooze.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:23.634
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:23.634 --> 00:02:27.601
♪♪

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:30.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:31.200
Hey, this is fun.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.901
Earlier tonight,
Elton John performed

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:35.300
on the South Lawn
of the White House.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.934
It was an exciting night
for the Bidens.

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.267
The concert started right
after dinner, at 3:00 PM.

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:41.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.801 --> 00:02:46.167
Biden hosting Elton John at
the White House makes sense.

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:48.234
There's no better anthem for
a 79-year-old president

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.968
than a song called
"I'm Still Standing."

00:02:49.968 --> 00:02:51.000
Don't you think?

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:55.334
Hey, I saw that it's
National Dog Week, everybody.

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:58.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:00.133 --> 00:03:03.901
And to celebrate, Tinder is
putting rescue dogs on their app

00:03:03.901 --> 00:03:06.567
to match them
with potential owners.

00:03:06.567 --> 00:03:08.467
It's exactly the same
as normal Tinder.

00:03:08.467 --> 00:03:10.901
Everyone says they enjoy food
and long walks on the beach.

00:03:10.901 --> 00:03:12.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.667 --> 00:03:15.100
And finally, a popular
craft beer in Australia

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:18.934
was recalled over concerns
of "excess alcohol."

00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:20.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.167 --> 00:03:21.767
Meanwhile, the people who
bought it were like,

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:23.334
"We can't recall anything."

00:03:23.334 --> 00:03:24.467
We have a great show, you guys!

